      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHOT OF WHISKY (2) has a strong record here with three wins and three placings from eight starts. Was out of placings last time (25.75) at Q Lakeside in a OPEN, finishing fifth and beaten 5 lengths. Rates on top and should go close. WHICH LEGEND (1) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Maiden winner three back (20.39) at this track over 350m. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. MISS ME (3) racing well without winning, placing at her last five runs. Last time finished 3rd over 350m at this track beaten 2.75 lengths (20.37) behind All On Al in a Grade 5 on October 16. Overdue and is among the main hopes. BROWN BREAD (6) hit the frame here last start and can sneak into the finish again.",
